## 3. Technical Specifications

### 3.1 Design Token System

All visual properties are encoded as CSS custom properties, enabling instant theme switching and systematic consistency:

```css
:root[data-theme="dark"] {
  --bg-primary: #0f0f13;
  --bg-secondary: #16161e;
  --bg-card: #1c1c28;
  --text-primary: #e0e0e8;
  --text-secondary: #808098;
  --text-muted: #5a5a6e;

  /* Accent — signal orange (tool association: PyTorch #EE4C2C, AWS #FF9900, Jupyter #F37626) */
  --accent: #ff6b35;
  --accent-dim: rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.15);
  --accent-glow: rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.08);

  /* Depth indentation (DAG layout) */
  --depth-indent: 4rem;
  --depth-indent-mobile: 1.5rem;

  /* Typography */
  --font-sans: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
  --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', 'Fira Code', monospace;

  --space-xxl: 5rem;
  --space-xl: 2.5rem;
  --space-lg: 1.5rem;
  --space-md: 1rem;
}
```

The light theme inverts colors while preserving the same structural tokens.

### 3.2 DAG Depth-Encoding CSS

```css
/* Mobile-first: collapse to linear on small screens */
.section { margin-left: 0; border-left: none; }

/* Desktop: depth indentation + vertical connector lines */
@media (min-width: 768px) {
  .section[data-depth="0"] { margin-left: 0; }
  .section[data-depth="1"] { 
    margin-left: var(--depth-indent); 
    border-left: 2px solid var(--accent-dim);
    padding-left: var(--space-lg);
  }
  .section[data-depth="2"] { 
    margin-left: calc(var(--depth-indent) * 2); 
  }
  .section[data-depth="3"] { 
    margin-left: calc(var(--depth-indent) * 3); 
    border-left: 2px solid var(--stroke-dim);
  }
}

/* Depth badges in margin */
.depth-badge {
  position: absolute;
  left: calc(-1 * var(--depth-indent) + 0.5rem);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
  color: var(--text-muted);
  writing-mode: vertical-rl;
  opacity: 0;
  transition: opacity 0.3s;
}
.section:hover .depth-badge { opacity: 0.8; }
```

### 3.3 SVG Edge Rendering System

Edges are rendered as fixed-position SVG overlays, recalculated on scroll (debounced to 16 ms via `requestAnimationFrame`):

```javascript
function renderEdgePath(svg, fromEl, toEl, weight, label) {
  const fromRect = fromEl.getBoundingClientRect();
  const toRect = toEl.getBoundingClientRect();

  const x1 = fromRect.right;
  const y1 = fromRect.top + fromRect.height / 2;
  const x2 = toRect.left;
  const y2 = toRect.top + toRect.height / 2;
  const cx = (x1 + x2) / 2;

  const path = document.createElementNS(svg.namespaceURI, 'path');
  path.setAttribute('d', `M ${x1},${y1} C ${cx},${y1} ${cx},${y2} ${x2},${y2}`);
  path.setAttribute('stroke', `rgba(255,107,53,${0.2 + weight * 0.5})`);
  path.setAttribute('stroke-width', String(1 + weight * 3));
  path.setAttribute('fill', 'none');
  path.dataset.label = label;
  svg.appendChild(path);
}
```

