## 4. Interaction Design

### 4.1 Animation State Machine

| Animation | Trigger | Mechanism | Duration | CSS/JS |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Hero entrance | `window.onload` | CSS `@keyframes fadeInUp` cascade | 0.6s/0.8s/1.0s | CSS only |
| Tagline typewriter | `DOMContentLoaded` | Typed.js on `#typed-output` | 2.5s per string | JS (CDN) |
| Section reveals | IntersectionObserver (15% threshold) | `.section.visible` → CSS transform/opacity | 0.6s | CSS + IO |
| Project card stagger | Observer on `.projects-grid` | `transition-delay: var(--i) * 0.1s` | 0.5s each | CSS inline style |
| Filter transition | Click on `.filter-btn` | Cards: opacity 0 → hide → show → opacity 1 | 0.3s | JS + CSS |
| Dark/light mode | Click on `.theme-toggle` | `data-theme` swap on `<html>` | 0.3s | CSS transition |
| Skill bar fill | Observer on `.skills-panel` | `width: 0% → target%` | 1.0s | CSS transition |

### 4.2 State Management

```javascript
const state = {
  theme: localStorage.getItem('ovan-portfolio-theme') || 'dark',
  filter: 'all',
  activeSkillTab: 'frameworks',
  activeSection: 'hero'
};

function setState(key, value) {
  state[key] = value;
  if (key === 'theme') applyTheme(value);
  if (key === 'filter') applyFilter(value);
  if (key === 'activeSkillTab') applySkillTab(value);
}
```

### 4.3 Accessibility Compliance

| WCAG Criterion | Implementation |
|---|---|
| **1.1.1 Non-text Content** | All SVG edges have `aria-hidden="true"` (decorative). Canvas has `role="presentation"`. |
| **1.3.2 Meaningful Sequence** | DOM order matches narrative sequence (Hero → Philosophy → Projects → Skills → Contact) — NOT visual depth order. Screen readers read depth-encoded content in logical story order. |
| **1.4.3 Contrast (Minimum)** | All text: contrast ratio ≥ 4.5:1 against background. Tested: `#e0e0e8` on `#0f0f13` = 13.2:1 ✅ |
| **1.4.4 Resize Text** | All font sizes in `rem`. Page zoom to 200%: no loss of content. |
| **2.1.1 Keyboard** | All sections reachable via Tab. Filter buttons via Enter/Space. Theme toggle via Enter. |
| **2.3.1 Three Flashes** | No flashing content. Canvas particles are static glow, not strobe. |
| **4.1.2 Name, Role, Value** | All interactive elements have `aria-label` or visible text labels. |
| **Reduced Motion** | `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` disables all animations. Typed.js text is static. Canvas pauses. |

