## 6. Implementation Roadmap

### Phase 0: Content Definition (30 min)
- Write `PORTFOLIO_DATA` constant: 4 projects, 8 skills, 3 philosophy principles
- Write `ATTENTION_WEIGHTS` matrix based on semantic tag overlap
- Create SVG placeholder project thumbnails (geometric/network patterns in signal orange)

### Phase 1: HTML Scaffold (45 min)
- Semantic HTML5 structure with `data-depth` attributes on all sections
- CDN `<link>` tags (Google Fonts, Font Awesome)
- Anti-flash CSS + JS in `<head>` (prevents white screen on dark mode)

### Phase 2: CSS Design System (60 min)
- CSS custom properties (design tokens) for dark/light theme
- DAG depth-encoding system (margin-left + border-left + depth badges)
- SVG edge overlay container (fixed position, pointer-events: none)
- Component styles: nav, hero, project cards, skill bars, philosophy, contact form
- Blueprint/schematic accents: dimension lines, graph-paper background
- Responsive: 3 breakpoints (mobile: linear, tablet: 2-col, desktop: 3-col + parallel skills)
- Reduced motion: `prefers-reduced-motion` disables all animations

### Phase 3: JavaScript Interactivity (60 min)
- `data.js`: `PORTFOLIO_DATA` + `ATTENTION_WEIGHTS` constants
- `main.js`: init, state manager, IntersectionObserver registration
- `components.js`: render functions for projects grid, skill bars, philosophy cards
- `theme.js`: localStorage persistence, anti-flash guard, toggle handler
- `edges.js`: SVG edge renderer with scroll recalculation (debounced via `requestAnimationFrame`)
- `hero.js`: Typed.js initialization

### Phase 4: Content Population (30 min)
- Replace placeholder text with AI Systems Architect content
- Verify all links (mailto, social URLs)
- Add comments marking replaceable content for user

### Phase 5: Performance & Testing (45 min)
- Minify CSS and JS (manual or via `terser`/`csso`)
- Test: Chrome, Firefox, Safari at 3 viewport widths
- Lighthouse audit target: ≥90 Performance, ≥95 Accessibility, ≥90 Best Practices
- Verify: no console errors, no layout shifts, all animations working

### Phase 6: Deployment (15 min)
- **Primary:** Single-file inline (`index.html` with all CSS/JS/SVG inlined) → Netlify Drop
- **Alternative:** Multi-file folder → GitHub Pages (`gh-pages` branch)

